WEBVTT

00:22.450 --> 00:23.920
Red 1 to 6.

00:23.920 --> 00:25.650
The resistance hideout is now under our control.

00:25.650 --> 00:27.760
Twelve shot dead, four surrendered.

00:27.760 --> 00:28.690
Awaiting your orders.

00:28.690 --> 00:30.160
6 to Red 1.

00:30.160 --> 00:32.660
Capture the two individuals who fled the scene.

00:32.660 --> 00:37.060
Download tracking data from AS-ll and pursue.

00:44.470 --> 00:46.030
Data downloaded.

00:47.910 --> 00:50.210
Commencing pursuit.

00:50.210 --> 00:54.710
Targets heading northwest through
the old city 2 km to the north.

00:55.080 --> 00:58.220
Heavy Warrior 2! Light Warrior 10! Follow me!

00:58.220 --> 00:59.280
Roger!

01:18.470 --> 01:19.630
What is it?

01:20.410 --> 01:21.810
Nothing. All clear.

01:21.810 --> 01:23.240
Let's go.

01:46.840 --> 01:47.700
Jin!

01:54.880 --> 01:56.100
Sana...

02:10.330 --> 02:12.190
I can't go on anymore, Jin!

02:12.190 --> 02:13.460
We're almost there.

02:13.460 --> 02:16.230
If we can get out through the station up ahead...

02:18.130 --> 02:20.330
Hurry, Sana. Come on.

02:33.350 --> 02:35.520
Target using 9mm bullets.

02:35.520 --> 02:39.390
Armor sustained no significant damage.
Muscle suits sustained minor damage.

02:39.390 --> 02:40.950
Avoid direct hits.

02:51.070 --> 02:53.000
MEDICAL
USE

03:16.930 --> 03:19.060
Sana, are you okay?

03:19.060 --> 03:20.580
Jin...

03:24.200 --> 03:26.690
Bring the gun out slowly to where we can see it!

03:29.300 --> 03:30.670
Slowly, I said!

04:09.880 --> 04:11.350
D-do you read me...

04:11.350 --> 04:14.720
A-an enemy Light Warrior and...

04:14.720 --> 04:15.810
the little girl are...

04:19.890 --> 04:21.290
Were you hit?

04:21.290 --> 04:22.290
I'm okay.

04:22.290 --> 04:23.880
It's from when I fell down...

04:24.030 --> 04:25.150
Jin!

04:26.460 --> 04:28.730
Don't worry, Sana.

04:29.700 --> 04:31.630
Thanks for saving us...

04:32.370 --> 04:33.960
Joe.

04:37.070 --> 04:39.940
2010 A.D.

04:39.940 --> 04:44.280
Hyper-hurricanes formed simultaneously
on a global scale,

04:44.280 --> 04:47.740
causing severe damage throughout the world.

04:48.480 --> 04:51.090
The population had grown to eight billion,

04:51.090 --> 04:53.790
but in one stroke, five billion lives were lost.

04:53.790 --> 04:57.190
The economic and military balance collapsed.

05:11.440 --> 05:16.070
North America, Russia and Northern Europe
were bound in ice.

05:16.210 --> 05:18.050
The plains sank into the sea.

05:18.050 --> 05:21.950
The world map underwent a dramatic change
and a state of chaos followed.

05:22.520 --> 05:25.520
The Japanese government created special
economic areas in various parts of the country

05:25.520 --> 05:28.350
and was able to achieve a
limited degree of recovery.

05:28.990 --> 05:32.430
Powered Assist Technology,
which had been developed previously,

05:32.430 --> 05:35.120
played an important role in the recovery efforts.

05:35.500 --> 05:39.270
However, outside of these special economic areas,

05:39.270 --> 05:41.530
poverty flourished and slums began to develop.

05:41.700 --> 05:45.240
The ruling class called themselves "Logos"

05:45.240 --> 05:48.380
and converted Powered Assist Technology
to military use.

05:48.380 --> 05:52.750
The poor were called "Revinus"
and were banished outside the walls.

05:52.880 --> 05:55.880
The countries of Asia,
fearing Japan's increasing militarization,

05:55.880 --> 05:59.750
formed the Asian Union, the AU,
which was modeled after the EU.

06:00.220 --> 06:02.750
They landed in Kyushu.

06:03.620 --> 06:09.220
They were met by a corps of Heavy Warriors
led by Gladiators from the special force Phantom.

06:09.600 --> 06:12.530
Japanese forces repelled this attack
with their overwhelming mobility,

06:12.530 --> 06:17.610
and the Japanese government signed a
mutual non-aggression treaty with the AU.

06:17.610 --> 06:23.270
Since then, the military has turned its focus on the
anti-Establishment groups in the country.

06:24.610 --> 06:28.070
Brought to you by
BiG-GuY Fansubbing

06:31.390 --> 06:36.080
Episode 1
Hell

06:33.490 --> 06:35.590
What's going on?

06:40.730 --> 06:43.830
There are three people here.
I don't see anyone else.

06:43.830 --> 06:45.300
Understood.

06:45.300 --> 06:50.200
There's a good chance that insurgents
are still hiding in the area.

06:50.200 --> 06:53.070
There will be a reward for anyone with information.

06:53.070 --> 06:55.480
However, let me warn you,

06:55.480 --> 06:57.210
it would not be in your best interest
to try to harbor one. You got that?!

06:57.210 --> 07:01.480
If you'll let me live in Logos
then I don't mind telling you!

07:03.020 --> 07:04.750
You know something?

07:06.420 --> 07:08.820
Me? I don't know anything.

07:09.860 --> 07:13.030
Don't get smart with me, you Revinus gutter rat!

07:13.030 --> 07:14.390
Move out!

07:18.000 --> 07:20.900
Man, he had some nerve. It wasn't even me.

07:23.600 --> 07:25.140
This is my share.

07:25.140 --> 07:26.640
No fair!

07:26.640 --> 07:28.610
Fine then, here.

08:04.610 --> 08:08.250
It's okay, Jin. I can do the rest myself.

08:08.250 --> 08:09.120
Don't worry.

08:09.120 --> 08:11.320
Spoken like a true princess!

08:11.320 --> 08:13.580
I'm not a princess!

08:13.960 --> 08:15.820
Shut up, Gora!

08:16.590 --> 08:17.530
Princess! Princess! Princess!

08:17.530 --> 08:18.180
Gora!
Princess! Princess! Princess!

08:20.360 --> 08:22.930
You brought this from Logos too?

08:22.930 --> 08:24.630
Medicine is valuable, you know.

08:24.630 --> 08:26.960
If you sell it over here, you can make good money.

08:28.740 --> 08:29.900
Gora...

08:29.900 --> 08:33.210
I don't know why you're hanging around us,

08:33.210 --> 08:35.610
but if you're searching for valuables...

08:36.010 --> 08:38.280
Hey! That's not a nice thing to say!

08:38.280 --> 08:39.510
I'm just...

08:39.510 --> 08:41.120
Just what?

08:41.120 --> 08:42.120
Oh yeah!

08:42.120 --> 08:45.590
I just went to look at that place
I showed you yesterday.

08:45.590 --> 08:48.660
That resi... residence hideout?

08:48.660 --> 08:48.820
Resistance!
That resi... residence hideout?

08:48.820 --> 08:49.880
Resistance!

08:51.630 --> 08:53.060
And how did it look?

08:53.060 --> 08:56.300
It was burnt to a crisp. There's nothing left.

08:56.300 --> 08:57.700
I see...

08:57.700 --> 09:00.130
It's amazing I even made it back safely.

09:00.130 --> 09:01.540
I guess...

09:01.540 --> 09:03.370
I almost got you involved too.

09:03.370 --> 09:05.040
That's not true, Jin.

09:05.040 --> 09:07.840
I was the one who asked you to take me with you.

09:07.840 --> 09:10.080
Because I didn't want to be left behind.

09:10.080 --> 09:13.180
"Because I didn't want to be left behind."

09:13.180 --> 09:15.150
Man, you're so easy to read, Princess!

09:15.150 --> 09:16.250
Stop calling me Princess!

09:16.250 --> 09:18.490
"Because I didn't want to be left behind"!

09:18.490 --> 09:18.990
Shut up, Gora!
"I didn't want to be left behind"!

09:18.990 --> 09:20.050
Shut up, Gora!

09:20.050 --> 09:23.090
Shush! Go away! Shush!

09:23.090 --> 09:24.130
Princess! Princess! Princess!

09:24.130 --> 09:24.330
Stop it!
Princess! Princess! Princess!

09:24.830 --> 09:25.260
Princess!

09:34.900 --> 09:35.930
Sana...

09:40.270 --> 09:42.780
That guy's kinda scary...

09:42.780 --> 09:45.110
No, he's not.

09:45.310 --> 09:50.770
You can't tell whose really scary
just by how they look on the outside.

09:52.420 --> 09:54.660
"Revinus deserve human rights too."

09:54.660 --> 09:58.130
There are many who say foolish things like that.

09:58.130 --> 10:03.060
Of course, people like that would be outcasts
even if they were in Logos.

10:03.060 --> 10:05.860
It's only natural that economic hardship
leads to crime...

10:12.110 --> 10:13.440
How rude!

10:13.440 --> 10:14.810
W-who the hell are you?!

10:14.810 --> 10:17.010
Identify yourself! State your affiliation and rank!

10:17.010 --> 10:18.350
Back off.

10:18.350 --> 10:19.470
What?

10:20.080 --> 10:21.410
You bastard!

10:24.020 --> 10:25.350
Major?

10:32.230 --> 10:33.120
It won't open!

10:35.000 --> 10:37.790
Get down on the floor and don't move!

10:45.410 --> 10:46.840
Is that it?

10:47.510 --> 10:48.980
Anyone else?

10:51.650 --> 10:55.050
Drop your guns! Or else, he dies!

10:57.690 --> 10:59.620
You too!

11:13.830 --> 11:19.070
The Tokarev is a single action pistol.
Next time, keep your hammer cocked.

11:19.070 --> 11:22.130
Damn it, you stole the show.

11:23.040 --> 11:25.350
Man, they sure brought in a whole arsenal.

11:24.320 --> 11:27.700
<b>Talk About the Future with Representative Kyuzo Sato</b>

11:37.990 --> 11:40.220
Man, you're irresistible!

11:54.340 --> 11:56.570
That's your fortune.

11:57.480 --> 12:01.780
The smell of gunpowder
doesn't go away that easily.

12:07.050 --> 12:09.680
See? I was right.

12:14.360 --> 12:16.000
Don't make me laugh.

12:16.000 --> 12:18.830
You were the first one to shoot, Steve.

12:18.830 --> 12:20.370
You're too forceful.

12:20.370 --> 12:24.740
Hmph! Lt'd be too late to go barging in
after they took hostages.

12:24.740 --> 12:28.770
You need to learn to distinguish
between terrorists and civilians.

12:29.510 --> 12:30.910
That's a bunch of bull.

12:30.910 --> 12:34.900
You know you like the smell of blood, too.

12:35.520 --> 12:38.620
Phantom sure has degenerated...

12:38.620 --> 12:40.350
What did you say?!

13:05.110 --> 13:07.240
I wasn't playing or anything!

13:08.120 --> 13:11.120
We'll need to do motion checks later.

13:11.120 --> 13:13.120
It's been in storage all this time...

13:13.120 --> 13:15.420
Hm? Is something wrong?

13:17.190 --> 13:19.520
Oh, the piano?

13:21.100 --> 13:23.460
Sorry, but the sound will echo.

13:23.460 --> 13:25.190
I know.

13:25.500 --> 13:26.990
Jin?

13:27.570 --> 13:30.000
Can I go outside for a little bit?

13:30.000 --> 13:31.970
I feel like I'm suffocating.

13:33.570 --> 13:35.670
Just around this area, okay?

13:50.830 --> 13:53.420
Silly... So you got all tangled up?

14:00.200 --> 14:02.540
Don't just stare blankly at it, Princess!

14:02.540 --> 14:04.210
This is a great food source.

14:04.210 --> 14:07.210
Cut it out, Gora. The poor thing!

14:07.210 --> 14:08.280
Stupid!

14:08.280 --> 14:13.250
When we run out of food,
we'll be the poor things!

14:13.250 --> 14:14.180
But...

14:14.180 --> 14:15.520
What do you mean, "but"?

14:15.520 --> 14:16.380
Gora!

14:18.850 --> 14:21.560
Sooner or later, they'll find us here.

14:21.560 --> 14:23.620
We should leave to avoid trouble... Right?

14:23.620 --> 14:25.090
We need transportation.

14:25.190 --> 14:26.290
Wait, Gora! Gora!

14:26.290 --> 14:27.090
Like hell I will!
Wait, Gora! Gora!

14:27.090 --> 14:28.030
Wait, Gora! Gora!

14:28.030 --> 14:29.460
Be quiet.

14:30.130 --> 14:31.600
But, Gora...

14:31.600 --> 14:32.760
What happened?

14:32.970 --> 14:33.970
A frog.

14:33.970 --> 14:34.800
Gora!

14:35.640 --> 14:37.040
I haven't done anything bad...

14:37.040 --> 14:40.570
I went through all this trouble for everyone,
so we can have food.

14:40.570 --> 14:41.040
Jin! Make Gora stop.
I went through all this trouble for everyone,
so we can have food.

14:41.040 --> 14:42.870
Jin! Make Gora stop.

14:43.040 --> 14:44.650
That poor frog!

14:44.650 --> 14:47.110
Gora, please let it go.

14:47.110 --> 14:49.580
Hang on! It really tastes good, you know!

14:49.580 --> 14:51.550
Haven't you eaten a frog before?

14:51.850 --> 14:53.410
Let it go.

14:54.320 --> 14:56.960
Man... gimme a break.

14:56.960 --> 14:58.730
There's something wrong with all of you.

14:58.730 --> 15:00.820
It's so delicious, you know...

15:00.930 --> 15:02.000
Gora!

15:02.000 --> 15:04.700
Shut up! That's why you're such a princess.

15:04.700 --> 15:06.930
Farewell, my dinner.

15:09.270 --> 15:10.670
Jin!

15:11.810 --> 15:13.940
Yeah, I heard.

15:13.940 --> 15:16.040
The nuclear power plant
has been taken over, right?

15:16.040 --> 15:18.850
So it looks like it'll be my turn now.

15:18.850 --> 15:21.840
Is the advance unit having a difficult time?

15:22.180 --> 15:23.750
So I hear.

15:23.750 --> 15:25.020
Talk about selfish.

15:25.020 --> 15:29.320
They're usually biased against Phantom,
but, when they're in a bind...

15:29.520 --> 15:33.330
In any case, a job like today's
won't keep 'em satisfied anyway.

15:33.330 --> 15:35.300
I'll leave it up to you, Renée.

15:54.280 --> 15:56.410
Give me food.

15:58.650 --> 16:01.060
I just don't get it.

16:01.060 --> 16:04.580
Why is that girl treated like she's so important?

16:05.990 --> 16:07.560
There's gotta be something in it for you, right?

16:07.560 --> 16:08.960
Like she's involved in a treasure or something?

16:08.960 --> 16:09.800
Don't know.

16:09.800 --> 16:13.230
Really? You don't have to hide it, you know!

16:14.170 --> 16:15.260
Damn...

16:16.040 --> 16:19.730
Look at 'em. Flashy as always.

16:19.940 --> 16:22.280
Hey, you know how it is over there, right?

16:22.280 --> 16:24.580
It's not stinky like it is over here, right?

16:24.580 --> 16:27.640
There must be great-smelling food
and women there...

16:28.980 --> 16:30.180
It's no different.

16:30.180 --> 16:31.280
What?

16:31.350 --> 16:33.390
The smell of the people who live there.

16:33.390 --> 16:34.860
Like what?

16:34.860 --> 16:37.050
Like rotten guts.

16:37.120 --> 16:38.590
Hurry up!

16:38.590 --> 16:41.560
This area's the border between Logos and Revinus.

16:41.560 --> 16:43.960
There are probes everywhere.

16:44.060 --> 16:47.230
Besides, why do we have to steal such a big one?

16:47.230 --> 16:48.970
Let's get a cooler-looking one!

16:48.970 --> 16:50.400
Shut up.

16:50.400 --> 16:53.810
Who do you think brought you here anyway?!

16:55.640 --> 16:57.470
See? I told you!

17:16.400 --> 17:18.700
"Adieu"...It means goodbye, right?

17:18.700 --> 17:20.030
Jin!

17:20.030 --> 17:21.970
Can you play too, Jin?

17:21.970 --> 17:24.870
I took lessons when I was young.

17:25.270 --> 17:26.670
I'm sorry.

17:26.670 --> 17:28.640
It's nothing to apologize about.

17:28.640 --> 17:31.480
I'd love to let you play, but...

17:31.480 --> 17:33.110
That's okay.

17:33.110 --> 17:34.920
Did you play often?

17:34.920 --> 17:37.280
I don't really remember.

17:42.260 --> 17:44.820
Joe! Are they here?

17:45.560 --> 17:46.460
Yeah.

17:46.960 --> 17:48.450
They're coming?

17:49.630 --> 17:52.860
Hide in the trap cellar underneath, okay?

18:00.540 --> 18:02.170
Wh-what the?

18:15.690 --> 18:17.950
Oh my God, why has this turned
into such a big deal?

18:20.760 --> 18:22.820
This is 2-7. North side, preparations complete.

18:23.130 --> 18:25.120
This is 8-1. West side, preparations complete.

18:25.600 --> 18:27.190
What's the situation inside?

18:30.670 --> 18:32.110
Three people confirmed.

18:32.110 --> 18:35.010
Your objective is to capture the girl:
Codename Venus.

18:35.010 --> 18:37.810
It doesn't matter whether the other two
live or die. Go in!

19:00.430 --> 19:01.370
Fire!

19:10.680 --> 19:11.700
R-retreat!

19:20.820 --> 19:21.980
W-what happened?

19:23.490 --> 19:25.290
It's no use! Fall back! Retreat!

19:34.900 --> 19:36.700
Lt... It can't be...

19:36.700 --> 19:38.010
What's a thing like that doing here?

19:38.010 --> 19:39.670
Why is it here?

19:40.140 --> 19:42.970
All Light Warriors dispatched
into the theater have been annihilated.

19:43.340 --> 19:44.880
Awaiting your orders!

19:44.880 --> 19:46.850
W-what's Venus' location?

19:46.850 --> 19:48.850
In a space under the stage.

19:48.850 --> 19:51.980
Okay. Lay down a barrage with the Cobras,
and send the Heavy Warriors in!

20:05.530 --> 20:07.590
So he still didn't let you go?

20:08.070 --> 20:09.590
That Gora...

20:16.540 --> 20:18.410
Don't get caught again, okay?

20:24.150 --> 20:25.240
What?!

21:11.530 --> 21:12.660
Joe...

21:28.850 --> 21:29.870
Sana!

21:30.950 --> 21:32.710
That's a funny sound...

21:34.320 --> 21:36.120
A funny sound...

22:23.600 --> 22:28.110
If at the end of our long memory

22:23.600 --> 22:28.110
Nagai kioku no hate ni

22:28.110 --> 22:33.940
Time will tear us apart

22:28.110 --> 22:33.940
Toki ga bokura o wakatsu nara

22:35.980 --> 22:42.620
If at the end of my sweet memory with you

22:35.980 --> 22:42.620
Kimi to amai kioku no hate ni

22:42.620 --> 22:48.930
You and I become one again

22:42.620 --> 22:48.930
Mata bokura hitotsu nara

22:48.930 --> 22:56.100
From a quietly stretched arm's length away

22:48.930 --> 22:56.100
Sotto te nobashita kyori kara

22:56.100 --> 23:00.810
I will search for the meaning

22:56.100 --> 23:00.810
lmi o sagasu kara

23:00.810 --> 23:06.650
Can you hear it? The words dance in midair

23:00.810 --> 23:06.650
Kikoeru? Kotoba ga chuu ni mau

23:06.650 --> 23:12.450
We shall meet when our wish is granted

23:06.650 --> 23:12.450
Kanaeta toki ni deau

23:12.450 --> 23:16.120
Leaving only their reverse behind

23:12.450 --> 23:16.120
Reverse dake nokoshite

23:16.120 --> 23:19.530
The torn words

23:16.120 --> 23:19.530
Chigireta kotoba

23:19.530 --> 23:25.660
Blurred time and light

23:19.530 --> 23:25.660
Kasureta jikan to hikari

23:27.830 --> 23:32.170
I have found them now

23:27.830 --> 23:32.170
lma, mitsuketa kara

23:33.570 --> 23:44.010
Next Episode

23:43.280 --> 23:46.450
Next time on Innocent Venus:

23:45.170 --> 23:47.650
Episode 2
Madness

23:46.450 --> 23:48.260
"Madness"
